OL,3,GNEWSAChanges to GCSE Maths 'pulling the
OL,4,Arug out from under pupils'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been calls to pause changes
OL,7,Fto GCSE Maths which will lead to many
OL,8,Fexams taken in November each year being
OL,9,Fscrapped.
OL,11,FFrom 2027, students will only be able
OL,12,Fto take their exam in November if they
OL,13,Fare re-sitting the subject.
OL,15,FOne head of maths in a County Tyrone
OL,16,Fschool said that was "pulling the rug
OL,17,Fout from under pupils who need those
OL,18,Fstructured manageable steps to
OL,19,Fsucceed".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
