OL,3,GNEWSAChanges to GCSE Maths 'pulling the
OL,4,Arug out from under pupils'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Department of Education (DE)
OL,7,Fsaid that schools had been given
OL,8,F"sufficient notice to plan for the
OL,9,Frevised arrangements".
